Package: openpbr
Type: Package
Title: 'OpenPBR' Surface Shading Headers
Version: 1.1.1-2
Authors@R: c(
    person("Tyler", "Morgan-Wall", email = "tylermw@gmail.com",
        role = c("aut", "cre"),
        comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3131-3814")),
    person("Adobe", role = c("aut", "cph"),
        comment = "OpenPBR BSDF implementation"))
Description: Provides the header-only 'OpenPBR' surface shading implementation
    from 'Adobe' for use by other R packages. Includes layered diffuse, metallic,
    dielectric, coat, fuzz, transmission, and subsurface material controls,
    bidirectional scattering evaluation, and importance sampling. Packages using
    these headers should list both 'openpbr' and 'glmheaders' in 'LinkingTo'.
    A small compiled interface verifies the headers and reports the supported
    material model version. The shading model is described at
    <https://academysoftwarefoundation.github.io/OpenPBR/>.
License: Apache License (== 2.0)
Copyright: file inst/COPYRIGHTS
URL: https://github.com/adobe/openpbr-bsdf,
    https://academysoftwarefoundation.github.io/OpenPBR/
Depends: R (>= 4.3.0)
LinkingTo: glmheaders (>= 1.0.1-1)
Suggests: Rcpp, glmheaders (>= 1.0.1-1)
Encoding: UTF-8
NeedsCompilation: yes
Remotes: tylermorganwall/glmheaders
